Package: com.example.splitcarplay
Name: SplitCarPlay
Version: 0.5.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Companion app (Trang chủ/Trên xe/Mô phỏng/Tài khoản) for a planned side-by-side CarPlay split screen, with a speed card that reads Vietmap Live's speed/limit directly. Real on-car split-screen hosting is currently disabled -- first hardware test left the CarPlay screen blank; see ROADMAP.md.
